Value Filldown,Required slot (\d+)
Value Required power_supply (\d+)
Value power_supply_status (\S+)
Value mode (\S+)
Value current_amperes (\d+(?:\.\d+)?)
Value voltage_volts (\d+(?:\.\d+)?)
Value output_watts (\d+(?:\.\d+)?)
Value fan_direction (\S+)
Value Filldown slot_input_watts (\d+(?:\.\d+)?)

Start
  ^\s*Slot\s+\d+\s*: -> Continue.Clearall
  ^\s*Slot\s+${slot}\s*:\s*$$
  ^\s*Input Power:\s*${slot_input_watts}\s*\(W\)\s*$$
  ^\s*${power_supply}\s+${power_supply_status}\s+${mode}\s+(?:${current_amperes}|--)\s+(?:${voltage_volts}|--)\s+(?:${output_watts}|--)(?:\s+${fan_direction})?\s*$$ -> Record

EOF
